        <p>A DESERTER FROM TEIE HIGHLANDERS.—Jamet Thompson was charged with being a deserter from the Argyle and Sutherland Highlanders, atstioned at Stirling Barracks since August, 1.837.—P.0 Cuncliffa stated that the prisoner gave himself up at the Police Office.—He was remanded to await an escort.</p>
