        <p>BOWLING.</p>
        <p>Lancashire and Cheshire Association. Individual Merit Competition.</p>
        <p>The annual tourney commenced at Prestwich on Saturday. Considering the large number of contests brought to at. isbue on the opening day (..f this annual competition it was to some ext nt unusual that so few proved of a close description. The only rie.ts determined by the odd shot were those between Bak.r. of Tvldisley, ag vast Rothwell. of Didsbury, and S. Jones, of Pendle- ton, versus J. Duggan. of Chentham.</p>
        <p>FIRST ROUND. J Parkinson, Pendleton 2l T Fielding, Harpurhey ... 5 1? (Members, Stretford 21 A Johnson, Broughton ... 15 It G 1 mer, Leigh H J Bennett. Newton 2l S Ashton, Leigh l7 H Coneily, Whitefield 2l J Whiteman, Uidsbury ... 18 W Crenshaw, Whitefield 2l W Murphy, itheetham...... 9 8 Jones, Peodieton 2l J Duggan, Cheetham 2O .1 Isherwood. Leigh......... 21 J Turnbull. Radc.iffe l6 a. Lever. Radcliffe P Fielding. Broughton. 2l B Houseley, Whit-field 7 W Wells. Didsbury 2l J Hopewell. Pendleton... 6 ti Marsh, Leigh " 2l J Warburton, Tyldesley... 10 D Biunion, Pendleton 2l J Barns, Cheetham l7 J F Wells, Dithbury 21 IL Eastwood, Whitefielsi... 14 J Nlitcro.t. Leigh H.......- 21 A Jones, Warungtou N... 15 J A hitehead, Pendleton 21 W Wrigl y Irl ,m l5 J Tootill, Prestwich A Mold, Leigh it 2l H Fogg, Warrington S l7 W Oldroyd. Whitefie/d...... 21 W Deskin. Leign K 7 it Baker,Tyldssley 2l W Hothwell, Diatibury 2O W Collie:, Ligh 2l A Dawson. Prestwich 8 ri 'lopping, Leigh It 2l IL anderton, Narrington 21 17 6 AlaoP. Stietford A Stn thurst, Whitetield ... 21 W Pickburn, Urrnston 11 Blackwood. R and T 2l J Bleak.ey Prestwich ... 19 A. Chambers, W itefield w o J liudepeth,Leigh if (absent) T Paulden, Cheethain 2l A Head, Timperley W Gregg, Uhe thsan ... ...... 21 R Turnbull, Hadcliffa lB W Hewitt, Dldsb Ty 2l H liothweil, War'ton N ... 12 It Westwell, N'ton-le-IV A ftagers. Broughton Lt H Gardner, Radcliff! H Lowe, Stri tford M Cla:k. Broughton W Wood. Warrington N ... 21 F Stretch, Did bu y J H trri.. De Trafford J Alison, Warrington, N. 21 0 Towers. iisrpuchey lf II Hulme, Whitefietd ...... ... 21 J Healey, Chile. ham l2 It distcliff, Leigh 2l L Morris, Radcliffe 1 If Smith, Whi afield m J Ashton Whitefield W Walker. Cheatha 21 H lio serieff. otrettord... 10 21 r Hamer. Leign sf 'Sampson, Didsbury 2l G Drinkwater,Tirtv: ertey 19 W Stewart. Stretford w.o. G Haugh Kersal (absent) W' eitudd, Didsbury J Harrison. Leigh it 2l A don , Tyld.isley 3 J Martin, White